cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use legal-rag-verifier or its evaluation, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "legal-rag-verifier: sentence-level verification with KV-cache rollback for legal RAG"
abstract: >-
  A verifier that checks each sentence of a legal RAG answer against the supplied statutory
  provisions while the model generates: a deterministic claim check and a DeBERTa-v3 NLI head.
  A rejected sentence is rolled back on the inference server's prefix cache and regenerated,
  optionally with the provision inserted at the cut point. The repository also holds the
  evaluation with an LLM judge in the NLI head's place, which is not part of the package.
